Single-colour logos of server software, AI tools and operating systems, drawn in
the process list and on connections. Most come from Simple Icons 16.36.0
(https://simpleicons.org, CC0 1.0); Redis is the classic mark from Simple Icons
12.0.0 and OpenAI comes from gilbarbara/logos (CC0 1.0). The paths are used as-is
and filled with the brand colour or the interface text colour. Some logos carry
their own licence, listed per logo below. The full-colour logos in color/ have
their own LICENSE.

The logos are trademarks of their owners. SSHL uses them only to show which
program is running or which system a server runs; this does not imply any
affiliation with or endorsement by those owners.

